{
  "_comment": [
    "The $names a brief can use. The lists themselves live in config/randomizer.json:",
    "every box and sub-category there is a variable automatically, under a name worked",
    "out by scripts/randomizer.py. This file only says what that cannot work out:",
    "",
    "  shorten   id prefixes swapped for a shorter one, first match wins",
    "  rename    an exact id to the name people will type",
    "  combined  one name drawing from several lists. `from` takes box or sub-category",
    "            ids, `except` drops some. `merge` true puts every term in one menu;",
    "            otherwise the menu lists the sub-categories and the terms roll inside.",
    "  nsfw      never drawn by a box or by Surprise-style names, only asked for by name"
  ],
  "shorten": {
